> Trace the actual conditional network

Each block computes a vertical gate, an unbiased vertical4→horizontal8 link,
a horizontal gate and a biased1x1 projection4→4. Blocks1 and2 add the prior
horizontal map as a residual. The final biased1x1 layer4→1 emits a Bernoulli
logit. Missing kernels/tables use normal(0,.1) initialization, biases zero.
There are no learned vertical-to-horizontal biases. The native API also accepts
an RGB3-channel input and30-channel context head for PixelCNN++, while its
within-pixel RGB likelihood remains a separate operation.

The executed trace below packs64 image coordinates and one supplied digit
label into65 coordinates solely for the plotting interface. It unpacks the label
as Int64 before the model call. Its two streams and supplied class are explicit;
no class is inferred from the image.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/gpc_network.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){
 namespace n=dm::nn;n::ParameterStore p(8501);
 n::Module model([&](const n::Tensor& packed){
  auto x=n::reshape(n::slice_axis(packed,1,0,64),{1,8,8,1});
  auto label=n::cast(n::reshape(n::slice_axis(packed,1,64,65),{1}),n::DType::Int64);
  n::model_stage("Supplied binary canvas",packed,x);n::model_stage("Supplied digit class",packed,label);
  auto o=n::models::GatedPixelCnn(p,x,label,true);
  n::model_stage("Block0 vertical gate",std::vector<n::Tensor>{x,label},o.vertical0);
  n::model_stage("Block0 horizontal",std::vector<n::Tensor>{x,label,o.vertical0},o.horizontal0);
  n::model_stage("Block1 vertical gate",std::vector<n::Tensor>{o.vertical0,label},o.vertical1);
  n::model_stage("Block1 horizontal residual",std::vector<n::Tensor>{o.horizontal0,label,o.vertical1},o.horizontal1);
  n::model_stage("Block2 vertical gate",std::vector<n::Tensor>{o.vertical1,label},o.vertical);
  n::model_stage("Block2 horizontal residual",std::vector<n::Tensor>{o.horizontal1,label,o.vertical},o.horizontal);
  return n::model_stage("1x1 binary logits",o.horizontal,o.logits);
 },"Conditional dual-stream PixelCNN:1553 stored values");
 n::ModelPlotOptions options;options.detail=n::ModelPlotDetail::Blocks;
 options.sizing.minimum_extent=2;options.sizing.max_planes=4;
 auto fig=model.plot(n::zeros({1,65}),options);
 if(fig.parameter_count()!=1553||p.size()!=29)throw std::runtime_error("Conditional census");
 fig.save_svg("build/gpc_network.svg");
}
