\caption(The1553-value conditional execution includes both stream paths, all three vertical-to-horizontal dependencies and the supplied class. Each stream map has width4; the binary logit head has width1.)
\alttext(An executed graph unpacks a binary canvas and digit label, traces three vertical gated maps with links into three horizontal residual maps, and emits one logit per pixel.)

> Fit both source variants with visible gradients and optimizer writes

The density factorization is the same as plain PixelCNN:
p(x|c)=product_j Bernoulli(x_j;sigmoid(z_j(x_<j,c))). Unconditional mode
validates the supplied labels but ignores them. In conditional mode the same
observed class c enters all six tables. The teacher-forced objective is

$$ L=\operatorname{mean}_{b,j}[\operatorname{softplus}(z_{b,j})-x_{b,j}z_{b,j}],
\qquad \partial_{z_{b,j}}L=(\sigma(z_{b,j})-x_{b,j})/(N64). $$
\alttext(The objective averages stable Bernoulli negative log likelihood over every binary pixel and row; its logit partial is probability minus target divided by N times64.)

Both variants use the canonical native MNIST saliency pools:1000 fit,200
validation and200 disjoint official-test rows, with labels, source IDs and a
provenance manifest. BinaryPixels performs Double half-pixel28→8 bilinear
arithmetic, casts once to Float32 and thresholds gray>=.5. These are deterministic
binary targets. The experiment's unit is a binary8x8 pixel, not an original
gray28x28 pixel. Divide NLL in nats by log(2) for bits per binary pixel.

The source has no TensorFlow initialization records at its optional reference
path; its auto default therefore uses native store seed8501. Each model gets
an independent store and cold Adam(.003), betas(.9,.999),epsilon1e−8, no
weight decay. BatchOrder seed8513 and batch size32 yield31 full batches and
one8-row batch in each of three epochs. There are96 writes per variant,192
total. The fixed final epoch3 is selected before viewing held-out losses.
The complete program saves every partial, write and optimizer counter, and
checks that all320 masked coordinates stay bit identical at every step.

Sampling remains a visible caller loop. A complete midpoint-MT Double[N,64]
bank is drawn in row/ordinal order even for prefix completion. At site j,
evaluate the current canvas, retain p_j and write [u_j<p_j]. Only the first32
truth sites enter a completion canvas; future truth is never fed. Class-grid
controls first draw the complete40-row bank, then reuse its first four rows
across all ten class groups. No hidden model method performs fitting or sampling.

```{cpp, results="markdown", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <fstream>
namespace n=dm::nn;namespace m=n::models;
using T=n::Tensor;using A=std::map<std::string,T>;namespace fs=std::filesystem;
void Save(const fs::path& file,const A& fields){
 n::NamedTensors named;for(const auto& [key,value]:fields)named.emplace_back(key,value);
 n::save_npz(file.string(),named);
}
A Weights(const n::ParameterStore& p){
 A out;for(const auto& name:p.names())out.emplace(name,p.at(name).detach().clone());return out;
}
bool Equal(const A& a,const A& b){
 if(a.size()!=b.size())return false;
 for(const auto& [key,value]:a)if(!b.count(key)||!n::equal_bits(value,b.at(key)))return false;
 return true;
}
A Partials(const n::ParameterStore& p,const std::vector<T>& g){
 A out;for(std::size_t k=0;k<g.size();++k)out.emplace(p.names()[k],g[k].detach());return out;
}
A Evaluate(n::ParameterStore& p,const T& x,const T& labels,bool conditional){
 n::NoGradGuard guard;auto o=m::GatedPixelCnn(p,x,labels,conditional);auto l=m::BernoulliPixels(o.logits,x);
 return {{"logits",o.logits},{"vertical",o.vertical},{"horizontal",o.horizontal},
 {"probability",l.probability},{"per_image_nll",l.per_image_nll},{"loss",l.loss}};
}
A Sample(n::ParameterStore& p,int count,std::uint32_t seed,const T& labels,bool conditional,const T& prefix={},int prefix_size=0,bool common_four=false){
 n::NoGradGuard guard;
 auto ordinal=n::reshape(n::arange(0,64),{1,64});
 T canvas=n::zeros({count,64}),conditionals=n::zeros({count,64});
 auto bank=m::BinaryPixelUniforms(count,seed);
 if(common_four){
  std::vector<std::int64_t> shared;for(int row=0;row<count;++row)shared.push_back(row%4);
  bank=n::take_rows(bank,shared);
 }
 if(prefix_size)canvas=n::where(n::less(ordinal,prefix_size),n::reshape(prefix,{count,64}),canvas);
 for(int site=prefix_size;site<64;++site){
  auto logits=m::GatedPixelCnn(p,n::reshape(canvas,{count,8,8,1}),labels,conditional).logits;
  auto q=n::slice_axis(n::reshape(n::sigmoid(logits),{count,64}),1,site,site+1);
  auto u=n::slice_axis(bank,1,site,site+1);
  auto bit=n::cast(n::less(u,n::cast(q,n::DType::Float64)),n::DType::Float32);
  auto at_site=n::equal(ordinal,site);
  conditionals=n::where(at_site,q,conditionals);
  canvas=n::where(at_site,bit,canvas);
 }
 return {{"images",n::reshape(canvas,{count,8,8,1})},{"uniform",bank},{"conditionals",conditionals}};
}
T Classes(int count,bool grouped=false){
 std::vector<std::int32_t> labels;for(int i=0;i<count;++i)labels.push_back(grouped?i/4:i%10);
 return n::from_vector(labels,{count});
}
int main(){
 for(bool conditional:{false,true}){
 const fs::path root=fs::path("build/gated_pixel_cnn")/(conditional?"conditional":"unconditional");
 fs::create_directories(root/"phases");
 n::set_num_threads(4);
 const fs::path data_root=dm::datasets::prepare_example_data("mnist-assets");
 const auto pools=m::LoadSaliency(data_root/"saliency");
 std::vector<T> binary;A data;
 const std::vector<std::string> split{"fit","validation","test"};
 for(int k=0;k<3;++k){
  auto prep=m::BinaryPixels(pools[k].images);binary.push_back(prep.images);
  data[split[k]+"_original"]=pools[k].images;data[split[k]+"_gray"]=prep.gray;
  data[split[k]+"_images"]=prep.images;data[split[k]+"_labels"]=pools[k].labels;
  data[split[k]+"_source_ids"]=pools[k].source;
 }
 Save(root/"data.npz",data);
 n::ParameterStore p(8501);
 {n::NoGradGuard guard;m::GatedPixelCnn(p,n::zeros({1,8,8,1}),Classes(1),conditional);}
 const auto initial=Weights(p);Save(root/"initial_arrays.npz",initial);
 Save(root/"initial_outputs.npz",Evaluate(p,binary[2],pools[2].labels,conditional));
 n::OptimizerConfig config;config.kind=n::OptimizerKind::Adam;
 n::Optimizer optimizer(p,.003,config);
 n::BatchOrder order(1000,32,8513);std::vector<std::int64_t> rows;
 std::ofstream batches(root/"batches.tsv"),history(root/"history.tsv");history.precision(17);
 batches<<"epoch\tstep\trow\tsource_id\n";
 history<<"epoch\tvalidation_nll_per_binary_pixel\tvalidation_bits_per_binary_pixel\n";
 auto source=pools[0].source.to_vector<std::int32_t>();
 std::vector<double> val_bits;T first,first_labels;int updates=0;
 for(int epoch=1;epoch<=3;++epoch){
  order.begin_epoch();
  for(;;){
   rows=order.next();if(rows.empty())break;
   const auto x=n::take_rows(binary[0],rows),c=n::take_rows(pools[0].labels,rows);
   if(!updates){first=x;first_labels=c;Save(root/"first_batch.npz",{{"images",x},{"labels",c}});
    Save(root/"first_forward.npz",Evaluate(p,x,c,conditional));}
   auto output=m::GatedPixelCnn(p,x,c,conditional);auto objective=m::BernoulliPixels(output.logits,x);
   auto gradients=n::grad(objective.loss,p.parameters());
   const auto phase=root/"phases"/("batch"+std::to_string(updates));
   Save(phase.string()+"-gradient.npz",Partials(p,gradients));
   if(!updates)Save(root/"initial_gradients.npz",Partials(p,gradients));
   optimizer.step(gradients);
   const auto after=Weights(p);Save(phase.string()+"-after.npz",after);
   Save(phase.string()+"-iterations.npz",{{"iterations",n::from_vector(std::vector<std::int64_t>{optimizer.iterations()},{1})}});
   if(!updates)Save(root/"first_after.npz",after);
   for(const auto& [key,value]:initial){
    bool vertical=key.find("/vertical/")!=std::string::npos;
    bool horizontal=key.find("/horizontal/")!=std::string::npos;
    if(!key.ends_with("/W")||!(vertical||horizontal))continue;
    auto mask=m::GatedPixelMask(key.starts_with("block0/")?1:4,vertical,key.starts_with("block0/"));
    auto forbidden=n::equal(mask,0);
    if(!n::equal_bits(n::where(forbidden,value,n::zeros_like(value)),
                      n::where(forbidden,after.at(key),n::zeros_like(value))) ||
       n::max(n::abs(n::where(forbidden,Partials(p,gradients).at(key),n::zeros_like(value)))).item()!=0)
     throw std::runtime_error("Masked coordinates changed");
   }
   for(auto row:rows)batches<<epoch<<'\t'<<updates<<'\t'<<row<<'\t'<<source[row]<<'\n';
   ++updates;
  }
  const double nll=Evaluate(p,binary[1],pools[1].labels,conditional).at("loss").item();
  history<<epoch<<'\t'<<nll<<'\t'<<nll/std::log(2.)<<'\n';val_bits.push_back(nll/std::log(2.));
  Save(root/("epoch"+std::to_string(epoch)+"_arrays.npz"),Weights(p));
  Save(root/("epoch"+std::to_string(epoch)+"_samples.npz"),Sample(p,16,8521,Classes(16),conditional));
 }
 if(updates!=96 || optimizer.iterations()!=96)throw std::runtime_error("96 Adam updates");
 p.save((root/"final.npz").string());
 Save(root/"final_gradients.npz",Partials(p,n::grad(m::BernoulliPixels(m::GatedPixelCnn(p,first,first_labels,conditional).logits,first).loss,p.parameters())));
 n::ParameterStore restored(8501);
 {n::NoGradGuard guard;m::GatedPixelCnn(restored,n::zeros({1,8,8,1}),Classes(1),conditional);}
 restored.load((root/"final.npz").string(),true);
 if(!Equal(Weights(p),Weights(restored)))throw std::runtime_error("Fresh restore");
 const auto before=Weights(restored),out=Evaluate(restored,binary[2],pools[2].labels,conditional);
 Save(root/"model_arrays.npz",before);Save(root/"outputs.npz",out);
 auto single=n::take_rows(binary[2],{0}),single_class=n::take_rows(pools[2].labels,{0});
 auto probability=Evaluate(restored,single,single_class,conditional).at("probability");
 if(n::max(n::abs(probability-n::take_rows(out.at("probability"),{0}))).item()>1e-6)
  throw std::runtime_error("Batch independence");
 A causal{{"images",single},{"labels",single_class},{"probability",probability}};std::vector<T> jacobian;
 auto ordinal=n::reshape(n::arange(0,64),{1,8,8,1});
 for(int site=0;site<64;++site){
  auto input=single.detach().clone().requires_grad_();
  auto logits=n::reshape(m::GatedPixelCnn(restored,input,single_class,conditional).logits,{1,64});
  auto gradient=n::reshape(n::grad(n::sum(n::slice_axis(logits,1,site,site+1)),{input})[0],{64});
  if(n::max(n::abs(n::slice_axis(gradient,0,site,64))).item()!=0)
   throw std::runtime_error("Current/future derivative");
  auto changed=n::where(n::greater_equal(ordinal,site),1-single,single);
  auto cp=Evaluate(restored,changed,single_class,conditional).at("probability");
  if(!n::equal_bits(n::slice_axis(n::reshape(cp,{64}),0,0,site+1),
                   n::slice_axis(n::reshape(probability,{64}),0,0,site+1)))
   throw std::runtime_error("Future-flip prefix invariant");
  if(site%8==0){causal["changed_input"+std::to_string(site)]=changed;
   causal["changed_probability"+std::to_string(site)]=cp;}
  jacobian.push_back(gradient.detach());
 }
 causal["jacobian"]=n::stack(jacobian);Save(root/"causality.npz",causal);
 if(std::abs(causal.at("jacobian").to_vector<float>()[34*64+28])<=1e-10)
  throw std::runtime_error("Vertical stream did not open blind spot");
 auto samples=Sample(restored,32,8521,Classes(32),conditional);Save(root/"samples.npz",samples);
 if(!Equal(samples,Sample(restored,32,8521,Classes(32),conditional)))throw std::runtime_error("Repeated sample bank/conditionals");
 auto truth=n::take_rows(binary[2],{0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7});
 auto completion=Sample(restored,8,8527,n::take_rows(pools[2].labels,{0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7}),conditional,truth,32);completion["truth"]=truth;completion["labels"]=n::take_rows(pools[2].labels,{0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7});
 Save(root/"completions.npz",completion);
 if(!n::equal_bits(n::slice_axis(n::reshape(truth,{8,64}),1,0,32),
                  n::slice_axis(n::reshape(completion.at("images"),{8,64}),1,0,32)))
  throw std::runtime_error("Observed prefix preservation");
 auto observed=n::where(n::less(ordinal,32),truth,n::full(truth.shape(),.5));
 auto gallery=n::reshape(n::stack({truth,observed,completion.at("images")},1),{24,8,8,1});
 Save(root/"completion_gallery.npz",{{"images",gallery}});
 n::save_image_grid(n::tile(samples.at("images"),{1,1,1,3}),(root/"samples.png").string(),8,0,1,0,220/255.,8);
 n::save_image_grid(n::tile(gallery,{1,1,1,3}),(root/"completions.png").string(),3,0,1,0,220/255.,8);
 auto shifted_values=pools[2].labels.to_vector<std::int32_t>();
 for(auto& label:shifted_values)label=(label+1)%10;
 auto shifted=n::from_vector(shifted_values,{200});
 auto shifted_probability=Evaluate(restored,binary[2],shifted,conditional).at("probability");
 const auto effect=n::max(n::abs(n::cast(shifted_probability,n::DType::Float64)-n::cast(out.at("probability"),n::DType::Float64)));
 if(conditional?effect.item()<=1e-6:effect.item()!=0)throw std::runtime_error("Conditional class effect");
 Save(root/"class_controls.npz",{{"labels",shifted},{"probability",shifted_probability}});
 auto grid_labels=Classes(40,true);
 auto grid=Sample(restored,40,8537,grid_labels,conditional,{},0,true);grid["labels"]=grid_labels;
 Save(root/"class_grid.npz",grid);
 n::save_image_grid(n::tile(grid.at("images"),{1,1,1,3}),(root/"class_grid.png").string(),4,0,1,0,220/255.,8);
 n::ParameterStore plain(8401);auto plain_input=single.detach().clone().requires_grad_();
 auto plain_logits=n::reshape(m::PixelCnn(plain,plain_input).logits,{1,64});
 auto plain_gradient=n::grad(n::sum(n::slice_axis(plain_logits,1,34,35)),{plain_input})[0];
 auto gated_gradient=n::reshape(n::select(causal.at("jacobian"),0,34),{1,8,8,1});
 if(plain_gradient.to_vector<float>()[28]!=0)throw std::runtime_error("Plain masked CNN blind spot");
 Save(root/"blindspot.npz",{{"plain_input_gradient",plain_gradient},{"gated_input_gradient",gated_gradient}});
 bool invalid_rejected=false;
 try{m::GatedPixelCnn(restored,single,n::full({1},10,n::DType::Int32),conditional);}
 catch(const std::invalid_argument&){invalid_rejected=true;}
 if(!invalid_rejected)throw std::runtime_error("Invalid classes accepted");
 if(!Equal(before,Weights(restored)))throw std::runtime_error("Inference wrote parameters");
 {n::NoGradGuard guard;
  auto posterior=(n::sum(n::cast(binary[0],n::DType::Float64),{0})+.5)/1001.;
  auto target=n::cast(binary[2],n::DType::Float64);
  auto baseline=-n::mean(target*n::log(posterior)+(1-target)*n::log1p(-posterior));
  Save(root/"baseline.npz",{{"probability",n::reshape(n::cast(posterior,n::DType::Float32),{64})}});
  Save(root/"summary.npz",{{"validation_bits",n::from_vector(val_bits,{3})},
   {"test_bits",n::cast(out.at("loss"),n::DType::Float64)/std::log(2.)},
   {"baseline_bits",baseline/std::log(2.)},{"class_effect",effect}});
  std::print("| {} variant | Value |\n|---|---:|\n| Fit / validation / test |1000 /200 /200|\n| Stored / active / masked values |{} /{} /320|\n| Epochs / Adam updates |3 /96|\n| Full causal Jacobian entries checked |4096|\n| Test bits per binary pixel |{:.6f}|\n| Fit-only Bernoulli baseline |{:.6f}|\n| Maximum probability effect of label shift |{:.6f}|\n",conditional?"Conditional":"Unconditional",p.count(),p.count()-320,out.at("loss").item()/std::log(2.),baseline.item()/std::log(2.),effect.item());
 }
 }
}
