> Show all samples and preserve every observed prefix

The final restored models generate32 samples each with seed8521, starting from
all-zero canvases. The supplied sampling labels cycle0..9 for both variants;
only the conditional model uses their values. Epoch snapshots also reuse8521
with16 rows, so comparisons use consistent random banks. The program repeats
final samples and requires images, uniforms and retained conditionals to match
bit for bit. Inference leaves every stored parameter unchanged.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/gpc_samples.png", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
